@base = http://localhost:4000
@origin = http://localhost:4000

### Sign in first (REST Client keeps the session cookie)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{ "email": "reader@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery" }

### Pick the workspace and the study set to work with
@workspaceId = paste-a-workspace-id
@studyId = paste-a-study-set-id

### List study sets (?type=QUIZ|FLASHCARDS|SUMMARY|MINDMAP)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/study

### Read one
GET {{base}}/api/v1/study/{{studyId}}

### Regenerate (409 while it is still generating)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/study/{{studyId}}/regenerate
Origin: {{origin}}

### Cancel one that is still generating (marks it FAILED with "Cancelled."; 409 once finished)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/study/{{studyId}}/cancel
Origin: {{origin}}
